# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
# 注意：下面的前导斜杠只匹配根目录，子项目的依赖要靠下面这两条
/node_modules
# services/signer 是独立包，依赖不能跟着提交
node_modules/
services/signer/dist/
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage
# Playwright E2E 产物（截图 / trace / html report）
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# tsc emit 给 user.js 用的临时目录（合并签名服务后留的）
/dist/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files
# 密钥一律排除。.example 模板要提交，所以下面反选回来
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example

# SQLite 用户库（绝对不能进仓库）
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
__snapshots__/
